{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/lia-avenew-development-dubai-islands","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1444,"crm_id":"7060","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Lia","slug":"lia-avenew-development-dubai-islands","display_address":"Dubai Islands","building_type":["apartment","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"AveNew Properties","price":2200000,"display_price":"2.2M","lattitude":25.300808517169,"longitude":55.314706763974,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Lia by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-avenew-properties/\">Avenew Development</a> is a boutique beachfront residential project, located on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-islands/\">Dubai Islands</a>, one of Dubai’s newest master-planned coastal destinations. Designed as a refined island retreat, the project seamlessly blends contemporary architecture with resort-inspired living. The project presents a limited collection of <strong>1, 2 and 3-bedroom apartments alongside exclusive penthouses</strong>, all designed to embrace panoramic sea views and seamless indoor–outdoor living.</p><p>Residents benefit from private wellness-inspired living, premium lifestyle amenities, and a setting that balances privacy with direct connection to the waterfront, making the project equally compelling for end-users and long-term investors.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_1bb71b747e.jpg","hash":"Feature_1bb71b747e","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_2206469a71.jpg","hash":"Banner_2206469a71","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://